    {
      "title": "Dividend Policy",
      "excerpt": "Dividend Policy Following the Separation, the Company will adopt a progressive dividend policy which reflects the medium- and longer-term earnings and cash flow potential of the Group, while maintaining financial flexibility and meeting the Group\u2019s broader capital allocation priorities. Subject to the Board\u2019s approval, the Group will target a payout-ratio of approximately [30-50]% over the medium-term as the Group\u2019s adjusted earnings per share profile improves. The Group intends to pay its annual dividend in two instalments with the interim dividend representing approximately one-third of the full year dividend payment. 8.B. SIGNIFICANT CHANGES [ Other than as disclosed in \u201c Note 30. Post balance sheet events \u201d of the Combined Financial Statements beginning on page F-106 , no significant change has occurred since 31 December\u00a02025. ] ITEM 9.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0THE OFFER AND LISTING 9.A. OFFER AND LISTING",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
